endpoint.response:
{ success: true, message, data: { active: ActiveDocument[], passive: PassiveDocument[], totals: { active: { total_amount: string, collected_amount: string, residual_amount: string }, passive: { total_amount: string, work_order_amount: string, paid_amount: string, residual_amount: string } } } }
ActiveDocument = { id: int, type: 'proforma' | 'invoice', number_label: string, // "{number}/{year}" document_date: string, // YYYY-MM-DD external_number: string | null, external_date: string | null, // YYYY-MM-DD customer: { id: int, name: string }, company: { id: int, name: string }, net_amount: string, vat_amount: string, total_amount: string, collected_amount: string, residual_amount: string, payment_status: 'paid' | 'not_due' | 'overdue' | 'seriously_overdue' }
PassiveDocument = { id: int, document_type: 'proforma' | 'invoice', document_number: string, document_date: string, // YYYY-MM-DD supplier: { id: int, name: string }, company: { id: int, name: string }, total_amount: string, // totale del documento work_order_amount: string, // somma total_amount delle righe sulla commessa (D-2) paid_amount: string, residual_amount: string // payable_amount - paid_amount }
Ordine di entrambe le liste: document_date desc, id desc. Liste vuote -> [] e totali "0.00". Totali = somme delle colonne omonime delle righe in lista.
